cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tsseg, please cite the paper below."
title: "tsseg"
abstract: >-
  tsseg gathers classic and recent algorithms for time series segmentation,
  change point detection and state detection, behind a single
  scikit-learn-style API, with the metrics to evaluate them and an interactive
  demo to compare them.
